id: E110
trigger_tool: cmake
phase: configuration
error_signature: cmake_minimum_required VERSION < 3.5.*|Compatibility with CMake < 3.5 has been removed|Update the VERSION argument
severity: 2
category: build_system
match_keywords: cmake, cmake_minimum_required, version compatibility, policy version minimum
title: CMake 版本兼容性问题（cmake_minimum_required VERSION 太老）
root_cause: CMake 4.x 不支持 cmake_minimum_required VERSION < 3.5，旧项目（如 woff2 1.0.2 要求 2.8.6）会直接报错退出。这是 CMake 版本升级的向后兼容性限制。
affected_scope: 所有使用老版本 cmake_minimum_required 的项目，如 woff2、brotli 等
verification_cmd: cmake --version && cmake -DCMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM=3.5 .. 2>&1 | grep -q "Configuring done"
rec_priority: 1
rec_description: 添加 CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM 参数强制兼容。例如 cmake -DCMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM=3.5 ..
rec_command: cmake -DCMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM=3.5 ..
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: manual
principles: []
similar_to: []
source_event: woff2 1.0.2 编译
draft: true
contributor_id: 9ADA
